  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Scan of the 1982 edition of the Jackson River, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the Department of Commerce. Surveyed in 1978; aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1980; last revised in 1992; printed in 1992.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 24 x 27.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
